---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="The ESG Advantage: Ethical Activewear Manufacturing for Global Brands"
  description="Learn how Fitclo's commitment to ethical manufacturing and social compliance helps high-volume retailers meet ESG targets and regulatory requirements."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Corporate Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">The ESG Advantage: <span class="text-accent italic">Ethical Manufacturing</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 20, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>10 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">For US and EU corporations, a $30,000 order isn't just about price—it's about risk mitigation. An ethical supply chain is your insurance policy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. Social Compliance & Human Rights</h2>
      <p>Fitclo is a **BSCI-audited facility**. This means we adhere to strict international standards for fair wages, safe working environments, and the absolute prohibition of child or forced labor. For large-scale retailers, these audits are essential for board-level reporting and public brand trust.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Transparency and Traceability</h2>
      <p>We provide full transparency into our supply chain, from the fiber origin to the sewing line. By using blockchain-integrated transaction certificates for our recycled materials, we allow our partners to prove their sustainability claims, avoiding the "greenwashing" traps that now carry heavy regulatory fines in the EU.</p>

      <div class="my-12 relative rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/Hcc2d5570d1a94d4ea98d26ce3312893dj.png" alt="Ethical Production" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Long-Term Brand Resilience</h2>
      <p>Investing in an ethical partner today protects your brand from the "forced labor" and "carbon tax" regulations of tomorrow. High-volume buyers who prioritize ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) compliance are seeing higher loyalty from Gen-Z consumers and easier access to institutional capital.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Mitigate Your Supply Chain Risk</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Request our latest BSCI audit report and social responsibility statement.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Download ESG Report</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
